# Generated reports - customer-sensitive output
*.pdf
*.html
estate-report.*
Arc-SQL-Estate-Analysis-Report.*

# Local, uncommitted estate analysis outputs (contain tenant-identifying data).
# Every agent run writes the rendered report + dashboard artifacts here.
# The folder itself is tracked (via its README) but its generated contents are never committed.
/.local-reports/*
!/.local-reports/README.md

# Secrets and local CVE-enrichment cache - never commit
.env
*.env
NVD_API_KEY*
**/.cache/
**/cve-cache/
**/security-exposure-run/
